  "notes": "FY2025: total gold output 27,225.68 kg (875,325 oz, +2.93% YoY) — mine-produced 19,791.85 kg (636,322 oz, +7.93%), smelted/processed gold 7,433.83 kg (239,003 oz). Revenue RMB18,055.6M (+56.3%), net profit RMB4,439.7M (+139.8%), profit before tax RMB5,569M. Average recovery rate of the 14 productive gold mines ~91.19%. Gold ore reserve consumed in 2025: 12,393,503 t at 1.67 g/t; copper ore reserve consumed: 1,903,520 t at 1.04%. January 2025: acquired 100% of SDZQ (Shandong Zeqing Enterprise Management), gaining 85% of Yantai Jinzhi Mining. Overseas: Abujar Gold Mine (Côte d'Ivoire) via Tietto Minerals (100%); Gold Lion Mining (Sierra Leone, 60%). Gansu Zhaojin Precious Metal Smelting (65%) handles smelting. Chairman Jiang Guipeng. Per-mine production, costs and AISC are not disclosed (null above); reserve/resource tables (JORC) are complete. report_url not captured at download time (null).",
